type: software
title: "entente: a ruleset-generalized Diplomacy engine and AI research project"
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch Diplomacy engine generalizing adjudication to a
  ruleset-parameterized stable-labeling calculus (certified against the DATC
  and an original Beleriand variant test suite), plus game-theoretic agents
  and KL-regularized (piKL) search built on top of it.
